Subject: [PATCH 6.1 089/239] net: bcmgenet: Remove phy_stop() from bcmgenet_netif_stop()
Date: Mon, 15 May 2023 18:25:52 +0200
Message-Id: <20230515161724.344429171@linuxfoundation.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.40.1
